        { "text": "请问，茶馆在哪儿？", "reading": "Qǐngwèn, cháguǎn zài nǎr?", "gloss": { "en": "Excuse me, where's the tea house?", "bn": "মাফ করবেন, চায়ের দোকানটা কোথায়?" }, "clip": "6d330ebeb7585f81" },
        { "text": "我也是第一次来。", "reading": "Wǒ yě shì dì-yī cì lái.", "gloss": { "en": "It's my first time here too.", "bn": "আমিও এই প্রথম এলাম।" }, "clip": "b400f89e977ca9b8" }
      ]
    },
