        { "text": "明天早点儿来。", "reading": "Míngtiān zǎo diǎnr lái.", "gloss": { "en": "Come early tomorrow.", "bn": "কাল তাড়াতাড়ি এসো।" }, "clip": "92fba0b4922c9425" }
